      "faqs": [
        {
          "question": "How do I book my spot?",
          "answer": "To book your seat in our 5-Day yoga retreat program, all you need to do is pay an advance deposit fee of 20% of the total cost. This is necessary so that we can book your seat. The remaining fee can be paid when you arrive. Please note that the advance deposit fee is non-refundable."
        },
        {
          "question": "Is this retreat family-friendly?",
          "answer": "Yes, our 5-day yoga retreat is family-friendly."
        },
        {
          "question": "How do I reach the school?",
          "answer": "When you arrive at the New Delhi Airport (Indira Gandhi International Airport), book a domestic flight to Dehradun Airport (DED) from Delhi (DEL). From Dehradun Airport, we offer a free taxi pickup service to our yoga retreat at an additional charge of 80 USD. You can also hire local drivers to drop you off in Tapovan, Rishikesh."
        },
        {
          "question": "Do I need prior yoga experience?",
          "answer": "Absolutely, we offer an experience that is inclusive of everyone, be it beginners or professional yoga teachers."
        },
        {
          "question": "What should I pack?",
          "answer": "Make sure to bring your clothes and daily essentials, like phone chargers, toiletries, etc. We also advise you to bring yoga clothes. Apart from this, all other things required for the course will be provided by us."
        },
        {
          "question": "When is the best time to visit Rishikesh?",
          "answer": "The best time to visit Rishikesh is during October to February (Winter Season) and March to June (Summer season). Expect a lot of rain during July and September, which also increases the chances of landslides and roadblocks."
        },
